"│   ▼ Borrowing  3 q, 2 a          ││ finish stop  reasoning raw               │"
"│     ▼ [a] What happens to a borr ││ ── reasoning ──                          │"
"│         answer                   ││ Let me think about what a move does to a │"
"│     ▶ [x] Why can't a &mut and a ││ borrow.                                  │"
"│       [ ] When does NLL end a bo ││ The borrow checker tracks every live     │"
"│   ▶ Lifetimes  1 q, 1 a          ││ reference to the owner.                  │"
"│   ▶ (missing subtopic)  1 q, 1 a ││ A move invalidates the owner's place, so │"
"│   traits  0 sub, 0 q, 0 a        ││ no borrow may outlive it.                │"
"│ ▶ old_topic (not configured)     ││ ── answer ──                             │"
"│                                  ││ The borrow must end before the move.     │"
"│                                  ││ If a reference is still used after the   │"
"│                                  ││ move, the compiler reports E0505: cannot │"
"│                                  ││ move out of the value because it is      │"
"│                                  ││ borrowed.                                │"
"│                                  ││ Non-lexical lifetimes end a borrow at    │"
"│                                  ││ its last use, not at the end of its      │"
"│                                  ││ scope, so many such programs compile.    │"
